msgid "5 June 2026\n"
msgstr "5 Hunyo 2026\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Support for the Store instruction on IBM&reg; QPUs** - Now you can "
"simplify complex classical computations in your quantum circuits with the "
"Store instruction. [*Read more*](#store-instruction)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Suporta para sa instruksyong Store sa mga IBM&reg; QPU** - Maaari ka na "
"ngayong pasimplehin ang mga kumplikadong classical na kalkulasyon sa iyong "
"mga quantum circuit gamit ang instruksyong Store. [*Magbasa pa*](#store-"
"instruction)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "29 May 2026\n"
msgstr "29 Mayo 2026\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Qiskit Code Assistant service discontinued** - The preview service has "
"been discontinued and the Visual Studio Code and JupyterLab extensions have "
"been archived. [*Read more*](#qca-sunset)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Inihinto na ang serbisyo ng Qiskit Code Assistant** - Inihinto na ang "
"preview na serbisyo at na-archive na ang mga extension para sa Visual Studio"
" Code at JupyterLab. [*Magbasa pa*](#qca-sunset)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "28 May 2026\n"
msgstr "28 Mayo 2026\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**New Classroom Accounts** - Professors can now request a Classroom Account "
"to manage and facilitate access for their students. With Classroom Accounts,"
" students can use Open Plan resources without needing to provide personal "
"credit card information. [*Read more*](#classroom-accounts)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mga Bagong Classroom Account** - Maaari na ngayong humiling ang mga "
"propesor ng Classroom Account para pamahalaan at mapadali ang access para sa"
" kanilang mga estudyante. Sa pamamagitan ng mga Classroom Account, maaaring "
"gumamit ang mga estudyante ng Open Plan resources nang hindi na kailangang "
"magbigay ng personal na impormasyon sa credit card. [*Magbasa "
"pa*](#classroom-accounts)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "18 May 2026\n"
msgstr "18 Mayo 2026\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- **Introducing the Executor primitive** - We're excited to announce the release of the new `Executor` primitive and a new version of the noise-learning helper class, `NoiseLearnerV3`, both of which were first previewed at QDC 2025. [*Read more*](#executor-primitive)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"- **Ipinapakilala ang Executor primitive** - Masaya kaming iulat ang paglabas ng bagong primitive na `Executor` at isang bagong bersyon ng noise-learning helper class na `NoiseLearnerV3`, na parehong unang na-preview sa QDC 2025. [*Magbasa pa*](#executor-primitive)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

