#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Platform {#ibm-quantum-platform}"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Platform {#ibm-quantum-platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This section summarizes the recent enhancements and new features for the new"
" [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ibinubuod ng seksyong ito ang mga kamakailang pagpapahusay at bagong feature"
" ng bagong [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "May 2026 {#may-2026}"
msgstr "Mayo 2026 {#may-2026}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"store-instruction\"></span>\n"
"- **Support for the [Store](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#store) instruction on IBM&reg; QPUs** - Now you can simplify complex classical computations in your quantum circuits with the Store instruction.\n"
msgstr ""
"<span id=\"store-instruction\"></span>\n"
"- **Suporta para sa instruksyong [Store](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#store) sa mga IBM&reg; QPU** - Maaari ka na ngayong pasimplehin ang mga kumplikadong classical na kalkulasyon sa iyong mga quantum circuit gamit ang instruksyong Store.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compute a classical expression mid-circuit and save the result to a variable"
" or register, which can then immediately control subsequent quantum gates.  "
"Instead of deeply nested inline expressions, you can break computations into"
" named intermediate steps, so that complex classical feedback logic is "
"easier to read and maintain. **Common use cases** include the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kalkulahin ang isang classical na expression sa kalagitnaan ng circuit at "
"i-save ang resulta sa isang variable o register, na agad na maaaring "
"kontrolin ang mga kasunod na quantum gate. Sa halip na mga malalim na nested"
" inline expression, maaari mong hatiin ang mga kalkulasyon sa mga "
"pinangalanang intermediate na hakbang, para ang kumplikadong classical "
"feedback logic ay mas madaling basahin at pamahalaan. Kasama sa mga "
"**karaniwang use case** ang mga sumusunod:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Dynamic circuits with mid-circuit measurements and classical feedback  \n"
msgstr ""
"Mga dynamic na circuit na may mid-circuit measurement at classical feedback"
"  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '      * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Long-range entanglement preparation  \n"
msgstr "Paghahanda ng long-range entanglement  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '      * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Complex conditional logic based on measurement outcomes\n"
msgstr "Kumplikadong conditional logic batay sa mga resulta ng measurement\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    To use the store instruction, first ensure you're running the latest "
"version of `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (`pip install --upgrade qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime`), then see the [documentation](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-"
"control-flow#store) for more information and an example.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Para gamitin ang instruksyong store, tiyaking nagpapatakbo ka ng "
"pinakabagong bersyon ng `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (`pip install --upgrade qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime`), pagkatapos ay tingnan ang [dokumentasyon](/guides/classical-"
"feedforward-and-control-flow#store) para sa karagdagang impormasyon at isang"
" halimbawa.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    *Note that before submitting jobs, you should verify compatibility with "
"each primitive's options in the documentation*: [Sampler "
"options](/guides/sampler-options) | [Estimator options](/guides/estimator-"
"options) | [Executor options](/guides/executor-options)\n"
msgstr ""
"    *Tandaan na bago magsumite ng mga trabaho, dapat mong i-verify ang "
"compatibility sa mga opsyon ng bawat primitive sa dokumentasyon*: [Mga "
"opsyon ng Sampler](/guides/sampler-options) | [Mga opsyon ng "
"Estimator](/guides/estimator-options) | [Mga opsyon ng "
"Executor](/guides/executor-options)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"classroom-accounts\"></span>\n"
"- **New Classroom Accounts**: Professors can now request a [Classroom Account](/guides/classroom-accounts) to manage and facilitate access for their students. With Classroom Accounts, students can use Open Plan resources without needing to provide personal credit card information.\n"
msgstr ""
"<span id=\"classroom-accounts\"></span>\n"
"- **Mga Bagong Classroom Account**: Maaari na ngayong humiling ang mga propesor ng [Classroom Account](/guides/classroom-accounts) para pamahalaan at mapadali ang access para sa kanilang mga estudyante. Sa pamamagitan ng mga Classroom Account, maaaring gumamit ang mga estudyante ng Open Plan resources nang hindi na kailangang magbigay ng personal na impormasyon sa credit card.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"**Previous updates (2026)**\">\n"
"  ### April 2026\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"**Mga nakaraang update (2026)**\">\n"
"  ### Abril 2026\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**New export options now available in IBM Quantum**: Introducing new export "
"capabilities that make it easier for account administrators to analyze, "
"share, and work with their data.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mga bagong opsyon sa pag-export na available na ngayon sa IBM Quantum**: "
"Ipinapakilala ang mga bagong kakayahan sa pag-export na nagpapadali para sa "
"mga account administrator na suriin, ibahagi, at gumawa gamit ang kanilang "
"data.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "New in the [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) page:\n"
msgstr ""
"Bago sa pahina ng [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics):\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You can now export charts in SVG or PNG format.\n"
msgstr "Maaari ka na ngayong mag-export ng mga chart sa SVG o PNG format.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can export all analytics data, including the data behind the charts, as "
"CSV.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari kang mag-export ng lahat ng analytics data, kabilang ang data sa "
"likod ng mga chart, bilang CSV.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      Find the export menu at the top-right corner of each card on the "
"page.\n"
msgstr ""
"      Hanapin ang export menu sa kanang itaas na sulok ng bawat card sa "
"pahina.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"New in the [Access management](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) page:\n"
msgstr ""
"Bago sa pahina ng [Access "
"management](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users):\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Export both the Users table and the Access Groups table in CSV format.\n"
msgstr ""
"I-export ang parehong talahanayan ng Users at talahanayan ng Access Groups "
"sa CSV format.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "      Find the export menu at the top-right corner of the table.\n"
msgstr ""
"      Hanapin ang export menu sa kanang itaas na sulok ng talahanayan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**New resources and hardware for Open Plan users**: The [IBM Quantum Open "
"Plan](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/products) now features new learning "
"resources, new hardware, and a special one-time promotion for eligible "
"users.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mga bagong resource at hardware para sa mga user ng Open Plan**: Ang [IBM "
"Quantum Open Plan](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/products) ay may mga bagong "
"resource sa pagkatuto, bagong hardware, at isang espesyal na one-time na "
"promosyon para sa mga kwalipikadong user.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A new course, [Designing and leading quantum "
"projects](/learning/courses/designing-and-leading-quantum-projects), is now "
"available. This course covers key topics for users looking to develop or "
"secure funding for a quantum project, including early-stage planning, team "
"roles and responsibilities, identifying meaningful use cases, defining "
"measures of success, and a guide to grant writing best practices.\n"
msgstr ""
"Isang bagong kurso, [Designing and leading quantum "
"projects](/learning/courses/designing-and-leading-quantum-projects), ay "
"available na. Sinasaklaw ng kursong ito ang mga pangunahing paksa para sa "
"mga user na naghahanap na bumuo o makakuha ng pondo para sa isang quantum "
"project, kabilang ang maagang pagpaplano, mga tungkulin at responsibilidad "
"ng koponan, pagtukoy ng makabuluhang mga use case, pagtukoy ng mga sukat ng "
"tagumpay, at isang gabay sa mga pinakamahusay na gawi sa pagsulat ng "
"grant.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Heron r2 "
"[`ibm_kingston`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_kingston)&mdash;one"
" of our highest-performing quantum computers&mdash;is now available to all "
"Open Plan users.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Heron r2 "
"[`ibm_kingston`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_kingston)&mdash;isa"
" sa aming pinaka-performant na mga quantum computer&mdash;ay available na "
"ngayon sa lahat ng user ng Open Plan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Log 20 minutes of compute in any 12-month period and you can opt in to a "
"special one-time offer: 180 minutes for the next 12 months.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mag-log ng 20 minuto ng compute sa anumang 12-buwang panahon at maaari kang "
"mag-opt in sa isang espesyal na one-time na alok: 180 minuto para sa susunod"
" na 12 buwan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      With expanded runtime and new educational resources, users can run "
"everything from introductory circuits to advanced hybrid workflows.\n"
msgstr ""
"      Sa mas mahabang runtime at mga bagong educational resource, maaaring "
"magpatakbo ang mga user ng lahat mula sa mga panimulang circuit hanggang sa "
"mga advanced na hybrid workflow.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      These efforts reflect our commitment to open access, open education, "
"and open science in quantum computing. Read more: [Doubling down on open-"
"access quantum computing](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/open-plan-"
"updates)\n"
msgstr ""
"      Ang mga pagsisikap na ito ay nagpapakita ng aming pangako sa open "
"access, open education, at open science sa quantum computing. Basahin ang "
"higit pa: [Doubling down on open-access quantum "
"computing](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/open-plan-updates)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  #### Upcoming discontinuation of Qiskit Code Assistant service\n"
msgstr "  #### Paparating na pagtigil ng serbisyo ng Qiskit Code Assistant\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  On 29 May 2026, IBM Quantum will discontinue the preview Qiskit Code "
"Assistant service and archive the supporting extensions for Visual Studio "
"Code and JupyterLab.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Sa 29 Mayo 2026, ihihinto ng IBM Quantum ang preview na serbisyo ng Qiskit"
" Code Assistant at ia-archive ang mga supporting extension para sa Visual "
"Studio Code at JupyterLab.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Based on feedback and usage patterns, more users are running Qiskit Code "
"Assistant models locally and working in editor integrations that are already"
" part of their development workflow.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Batay sa feedback at mga pattern ng paggamit, mas maraming user ang "
"nagpapatakbo ng mga modelo ng Qiskit Code Assistant nang lokal at "
"nagtatrabaho sa mga editor integration na bahagi na ng kanilang development "
"workflow.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Qiskit Code Assistant models will remain available for local use. To "
"continue using them, move to a local deployment and a community-supported "
"editor integration or other local tooling.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Ang mga modelo ng Qiskit Code Assistant ay mananatiling available para sa "
"lokal na paggamit. Para magpatuloy sa paggamit ng mga ito, lumipat sa lokal "
"na deployment at isang community-supported na editor integration o iba pang "
"lokal na tooling.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  For setup guidance, see the [Qiskit Code Assistant](/guides/qiskit-code-"
"assistant) guide.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Para sa gabay sa setup, tingnan ang gabay na [Qiskit Code "
"Assistant](/guides/qiskit-code-assistant).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  #### Nighthawk arrives in the EU\n"
msgstr "  #### Dumating na ang Nighthawk sa EU\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Premium and Flex Plans now have early access to "
"[`ibm_berlin`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_berlin)! "
"It is the first IBM Quantum Nighthawk r1 QPU in the EU (`eu-de` region) and "
"the second Nighthawk in our global fleet, after "
"[`ibm_miami`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_miami) in "
"the US (`us-east` region). `ibm_berlin` features faster two-qubit gates than"
" `ibm_miami` (68 ns versus 138 ns, median) while maintaining similar fleet-"
"leading coherence (T$_1$ of ~350 &#181;s).\n"
msgstr ""
"  Ang mga Premium at Flex Plan ay may maagang access na ngayon sa "
"[`ibm_berlin`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_berlin)! "
"Ito ang unang IBM Quantum Nighthawk r1 QPU sa EU (rehiyon ng `eu-de`) at ang"
" pangalawang Nighthawk sa aming pandaigdigang fleet, pagkatapos ng "
"[`ibm_miami`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_miami) sa "
"US (rehiyon ng `us-east`). Ang `ibm_berlin` ay may mas mabilis na two-qubit "
"gate kaysa sa `ibm_miami` (68 ns kumpara sa 138 ns, median) habang "
"pinapanatili ang katulad na fleet-leading coherence (T$_1$ na ~350 "
"&#181;s).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Since its release, Nighthawk has enabled research in regimes where "
"classical simulation becomes increasingly challenging. Specifically, its "
"architecture supports hardware-efficient workflows that map naturally onto "
"grid-based (lattice) models. See recent papers from "
"[Phasecraft](https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.12236) and "
"[Volkswagen](https://doi.org/10.3390/e28040367), and their collaborators, "
"demonstrating simulation at scale on Nighthawk.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Mula nang mapalabas ito, ang Nighthawk ay nagbibigay-daan sa pananaliksik "
"sa mga rehimen kung saan ang classical simulation ay nagiging lalong "
"mahirap. Partikular, ang arkitektura nito ay sumusuporta sa mga hardware-"
"efficient na workflow na natural na nama-map sa mga grid-based (lattice) na "
"modelo. Tingnan ang mga kamakailang papel mula sa "
"[Phasecraft](https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.12236) at "
"[Volkswagen](https://doi.org/10.3390/e28040367), at ang kanilang mga "
"collaborator, na nagpapakita ng simulation sa scale sa Nighthawk.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Please note that `ibm_berlin` is currently an exploratory QPU that is "
"still being tested and optimized as part of our continual cycles of "
"learning. As such, it temporarily has the following limitations:\n"
msgstr ""
"  Pakitandaan na ang `ibm_berlin` ay kasalukuyang isang exploratory QPU na "
"patuloy pa ring sinusubukan at ino-optimize bilang bahagi ng aming patuloy "
"na mga siklo ng pag-aaral. Dahil dito, pansamantalang mayroon itong mga "
"sumusunod na limitasyon:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Default repetition time has been temporarily increased from 250 &#181;s to "
"4 ms, which impacts QPU time required to execute workloads. Users can "
"manually select a shorter repetition time, but performance might be "
"degraded.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang default na repetition time ay pansamantalang pinalaki mula 250 &#181;s "
"hanggang 4 ms, na nakakaapekto sa QPU time na kailangan para isagawa ang mga"
" workload. Maaaring manu-manong pumili ang mga user ng mas maikling "
"repetition time, ngunit maaaring mabawasan ang performance.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Dynamic circuits are not yet supported, and quality of mid-circuit "
"measurements is limited.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hindi pa sinusuportahan ang mga dynamic circuit, at limitado ang kalidad ng "
"mga mid-circuit measurement.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  #### Upcoming retirements\n"
msgstr "  #### Mga paparating na pagreretiro\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  As we expand EU capacity and roll out the latest Nighthawk and Heron "
"processors, `ibm_brussels` and `ibm_strasbourg` are scheduled to be retired "
"on or around 30 April 2026.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Habang pinapalawak namin ang kapasidad sa EU at isinasagawa ang "
"pinakabagong mga Nighthawk at Heron processor, ang `ibm_brussels` at "
"`ibm_strasbourg` ay nakatakdang ireretiro sa o kalapit ng 30 Abril 2026.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Once these QPUs are retired, they will no longer accept jobs. If your "
"workflows target `ibm_brussels` or `ibm_strasbourg`, please migrate to "
"another active QPU ahead of the retirement date to take advantage of the "
"latest systems. For guidance on retrieving data from past jobs, refer to the"
" following [documentation](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-"
"retired-qpu).\n"
msgstr ""
"  Kapag nireretiro ang mga QPU na ito, hindi na sila tatanggap ng mga "
"trabaho. Kung ang iyong mga workflow ay nagta-target ng `ibm_brussels` o "
"`ibm_strasbourg`, mangyaring lumipat sa isa pang aktibong QPU bago ang petsa"
" ng pagreretiro para samantalahin ang pinakabagong mga sistema. Para sa "
"gabay sa pagkuha ng data mula sa mga nakaraang trabaho, sumangguni sa "
"sumusunod na [dokumentasyon](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-"
"retired-qpu).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  #### `ibm_torino` is now retired\n"
msgstr "  #### Nireretiro na ang `ibm_torino`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  The quantum computer `ibm_torino` has been retired and will no longer "
"accept workload submissions. Any workloads that were already queued on this "
"QPU might still be processed and return results.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Ang quantum computer na `ibm_torino` ay nireretiro na at hindi na "
"tatanggap ng mga pagsumite ng workload. Ang anumang workload na nakapila na "
"sa QPU na ito ay maaari pa ring maproseso at magbalik ng mga resulta.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  If you would like to retrieve job data from important workloads run on "
"this QPU, refer to [these instructions.](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-"
"job-from-a-retired-qpu)\n"
msgstr ""
"  Kung nais mong makuha ang data ng trabaho mula sa mga importanteng "
"workload na pinatakbo sa QPU na ito, sumangguni sa [mga tagubilin na "
"ito.](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  #### ibm_brussels and ibm_strasbourg are now retired\n"
msgstr "  #### Nireretiro na ang ibm_brussels at ibm_strasbourg\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  `ibm_brussels` and `ibm_strasbourg` have been retired and will no longer "
"accept jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Ang `ibm_brussels` at `ibm_strasbourg` ay nireretiro na at hindi na "
"tatanggap ng mga trabaho.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  This change is part of the continued evolution and expansion of the IBM "
"Quantum fleet in the EU, including the recently released Nighthawk QPU "
"[`ibm_berlin`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_berlin) "
"and the upgraded Heron r3 QPU "
"[`ibm_aachen`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen). "
"The global fleet has now fully transitioned away from Eagle, IBM Quantum's "
"first utility‑scale processor family, introduced in 2021.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Ang pagbabagong ito ay bahagi ng patuloy na ebolusyon at pagpapalawak ng "
"IBM Quantum fleet sa EU, kabilang ang kamakailang inilabas na Nighthawk QPU "
"[`ibm_berlin`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_berlin) at"
" ang na-upgrade na Heron r3 QPU "
"[`ibm_aachen`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen). "
"Ang pandaigdigang fleet ay ganap nang lumipat mula sa Eagle, ang unang "
"utility-scale processor family ng IBM Quantum, na ipinakilala noong 2021.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  If your workflows target `ibm_brussels` or `ibm_strasbourg`, please "
"migrate to another active QPU to take advantage of the latest hardware. For "
"guidance on retrieving data from past jobs, refer to the "
"[documentation](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"
msgstr ""
"  Kung ang iyong mga workflow ay nagta-target ng `ibm_brussels` o "
"`ibm_strasbourg`, mangyaring lumipat sa isa pang aktibong QPU para "
"samantalahin ang pinakabagong hardware. Para sa gabay sa pagkuha ng data "
"mula sa mga nakaraang trabaho, sumangguni sa "
"[dokumentasyon](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  ### March 2026\n"
msgstr "  ### Marso 2026\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  #### The EU gets its first Heron r3\n"
msgstr "  #### Ang unang Heron r3 sa EU\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Maintenance has been completed on "
"[`ibm_aachen`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen) "
"and the QPU is now back online in the eu‑de region.  `ibm_aachen` has also "
"been upgraded to be the first QPU in the EU to feature the latest [Heron "
"r3](https://www.linkedin.com/posts/jay-gambetta-a274753a_following-up-on-an-"
"earlier-post-https-activity-7364268815720824834-aZ0k) processor. It is the "
"third r3 in our global fleet, after "
"[`ibm_boston`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_boston) "
"and "
"[`ibm_pittsburgh`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_pittsburgh)"
" in the US.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Nakumpleto na ang maintenance sa "
"[`ibm_aachen`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen) at"
" ang QPU ay bumalik na online sa rehiyon ng eu-de. Ang `ibm_aachen` ay na-"
"upgrade rin para maging unang QPU sa EU na may pinakabagong processor na "
"[Heron r3](https://www.linkedin.com/posts/jay-gambetta-a274753a_following-"
"up-on-an-earlier-post-https-activity-7364268815720824834-aZ0k). Ito ang "
"ikatlong r3 sa aming pandaigdigang fleet, pagkatapos ng "
"[`ibm_boston`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_boston) at"
" "
"[`ibm_pittsburgh`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_pittsburgh)"
" sa US.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Heron r3 continues to deliver improved error rates and overall system "
"performance compared to Heron r2, demonstrating more reliable execution and "
"better results for workloads. For example, on `ibm_aachen`, we observe a "
"large boost in $T_2$ (phase coherence time) from 150&nbsp;&#181;s to "
"250&nbsp;&#181;s. You can view metrics like these for all QPUs in the shared"
" fleet on the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) "
"page.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Ang Heron r3 ay patuloy na naghahatid ng pinahusay na mga rate ng error at"
" pangkalahatang performance ng sistema kumpara sa Heron r2, na nagpapakita "
"ng mas maaasahang execution at mas magagandang resulta para sa mga workload."
" Halimbawa, sa `ibm_aachen`, napansin namin ang malaking pagtataas sa $T_2$ "
"(phase coherence time) mula 150&nbsp;&#181;s hanggang 250&nbsp;&#181;s. "
"Maaari mong tingnan ang mga sukatan tulad nito para sa lahat ng QPU sa "
"shared fleet sa pahina ng [Mga Compute "
"Resource](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  ### February 2026\n"
msgstr "  ### Pebrero 2026\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  #### `ibm_torino` to retire\n"
msgstr "  #### Pagreretiro ng `ibm_torino`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  The `ibm_torino` QPU will retire on or around 1 April 2026. Once this QPU "
"is retired, it will no longer accept jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Ang `ibm_torino` QPU ay magrerretiro sa o kalapit ng 1 Abril 2026. Kapag "
"nireretiro ang QPU na ito, hindi na ito tatanggap ng mga trabaho.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  If you would like to retrieve job data from important past jobs, please "
"refer to the following [documentation](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-"
"from-a-retired-qpu).\n"
msgstr ""
"  Kung nais mong makuha ang data ng trabaho mula sa mga importanteng "
"nakaraang trabaho, mangyaring sumangguni sa sumusunod na "
"[dokumentasyon](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  #### Increase in repetition delay time maximum\n"
msgstr "  #### Pagtaas ng maximum ng repetition delay time\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  To provide more flexibility for users, we have expanded the allowable "
"repetition delay time range from 20-500 &#181;s to 20-2000 &#181;s on our "
"Heron and Eagle QPUs. The Nighthawk QPU delay time range continues to be "
"1000-4000 &#181;s as previously announced. Note that if you choose to "
"increase repetition delay (`rep_delay`), it will have a direct impact on "
"your execution time and capacity consumption, but it might improve the "
"fidelity of certain circuits. The default `rep_delay` remains unchanged on "
"all QPUs.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Para magbigay ng mas malawak na flexibility para sa mga user, pinalawak "
"namin ang allowable na hanay ng repetition delay time mula 20-500 &#181;s "
"hanggang 20-2000 &#181;s sa aming mga Heron at Eagle QPU. Ang hanay ng delay"
" time ng Nighthawk QPU ay nananatiling 1000-4000 &#181;s tulad ng dati. "
"Tandaan na kung pipiliin mong palakihin ang repetition delay (`rep_delay`), "
"magkakaroon ito ng direktang epekto sa iyong execution time at consumption "
"ng kapasidad, ngunit maaari nitong mapabuti ang fidelity ng ilang circuit. "
"Ang default na `rep_delay` ay nananatiling hindi nagbabago sa lahat ng "
"QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  You can find more information about repetition delay time, including how "
"to change it, in [Qubit initialization](/guides/repetition-rate-"
"execution).\n"
msgstr ""
"  Makakakita ka ng karagdagang impormasyon tungkol sa repetition delay time,"
" kabilang ang kung paano ito baguhin, sa [Pagsisimula ng "
"Qubit](/guides/repetition-rate-execution).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  ### January 2026\n"
"  - The latest enhancements to the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page include the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"  ### Enero 2026\n"
"  - Kasama sa pinakabagong mga pagpapahusay sa pahina ng [Mga Compute Resource](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) ang mga sumusunod:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Unified QPU view** - All QPUs across regions are now displayed in a single"
" table, making it easier to see status and calibrations of the shared fleet "
"across the two regions. (You can still filter the Compute resources table by"
" region using the funnel icon.)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pinag-isang QPU view** - Lahat ng QPU sa iba't ibang rehiyon ay "
"ipinapakita na ngayon sa iisang talahanayan, na nagpapadali sa pagkita ng "
"status at calibration ng shared fleet sa dalawang rehiyon. (Maaari ka pa "
"ring mag-filter ng talahanayan ng Mga Compute Resource ayon sa rehiyon gamit"
" ang funnel icon.)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Single maintenance schedule** - The maintenance schedule is now at the top"
" of the page, even when no events are currently planned.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Iisang maintenance schedule** - Ang maintenance schedule ay nasa itaas na "
"ngayon ng pahina, kahit walang nakaplanong event sa kasalukuyan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**\"Instance access\" details** - When viewing a QPU's details, a new "
"Instance access section shows all instances that grant the user access to "
"that QPU for the selected account.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mga detalye ng \"Instance access\"** - Kapag tinitingnan ang mga detalye "
"ng QPU, ang bagong seksyong Instance access ay nagpapakita ng lahat ng "
"instance na nagbibigay sa user ng access sa QPU na iyon para sa napiling "
"account.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**The first Nighthawk QPU and latest Heron QPU are now available.** These "
"two powerful new processors debuted at the [IBM Quantum Developer "
"Conference](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qdc-2025) in November.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Ang unang Nighthawk QPU at pinakabagong Heron QPU ay available na "
"ngayon.** Ang dalawang makapangyarihang bagong processor na ito ay unang "
"lumabas sa [IBM Quantum Developer "
"Conference](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qdc-2025) noong Nobyembre.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Premium and Flex Plans now have early access to `ibm_miami`, the first IBM "
"Quantum Nighthawk QPU. Our most advanced quantum processor to date, "
"Nighthawk is a 120-qubit device with a square-lattice topology (218 couplers"
" versus Heron's 176) that is designed to support more complex workloads. "
"Nighthawk has the highest coherence of our fleet - even higher than what was"
" reported at QDC - with a median T1 of 350 &#181;s.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga Premium at Flex Plan ay may maagang access na ngayon sa `ibm_miami`,"
" ang unang IBM Quantum Nighthawk QPU. Ang aming pinaka-advanced na quantum "
"processor hanggang ngayon, ang Nighthawk ay isang 120-qubit na device na may"
" square-lattice topology (218 coupler kumpara sa 176 ng Heron) na idinisenyo"
" para suportahan ang mas kumplikadong mga workload. Ang Nighthawk ay may "
"pinakamataas na coherence sa aming fleet — mas mataas pa kaysa sa iniulat sa"
" QDC — na may median na T1 na 350 &#181;s.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that `ibm_miami` is currently an exploratory QPU that is still being "
"tested and optimized as part of our continual cycles of learning. As such, "
"it temporarily has the following limitations:\n"
msgstr ""
"Tandaan na ang `ibm_miami` ay kasalukuyang isang exploratory QPU na patuloy "
"pa ring sinusubukan at ino-optimize bilang bahagi ng aming patuloy na mga "
"siklo ng pag-aaral. Dahil dito, pansamantalang mayroon itong mga sumusunod "
"na limitasyon:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Default repetition time has been temporarily increased from 250 &#181;s to 4"
" ms, which will impact QPU time required to execute workloads\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang default na repetition time ay pansamantalang pinalaki mula 250 &#181;s "
"hanggang 4 ms, na makakaapekto sa QPU time na kailangan para isagawa ang mga"
" workload\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Dynamic circuits are not yet supported, and quality of mid-circuit "
"measurements is limited\n"
msgstr ""
"Hindi pa sinusuportahan ang mga dynamic circuit, at limitado ang kalidad ng "
"mga mid-circuit measurement\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additionally, Premium, Flex, and Pay-As-You-Go Plans now have access to "
"`ibm_boston`, our most performant IBM Quantum Heron r3 to date. It has "
"demonstrated an EPLG at 100 qubits of 2.15e-3, with 57 of 176 possible two-"
"qubit gates below the 1e-3 error level.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bukod dito, ang mga Premium, Flex, at Pay-As-You-Go Plan ay may access na "
"ngayon sa `ibm_boston`, ang aming pinaka-performant na IBM Quantum Heron r3 "
"hanggang ngayon. Nagpakita ito ng EPLG sa 100 qubit na 2.15e-3, na may 57 sa"
" 176 posibleng two-qubit gate na nasa ibaba ng 1e-3 na antas ng error.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Introducing instance archiving for administrators on IBM Quantum "
"Platform.** With this update, administrators can archive any instance within"
" their account. Archiving an instance ensures that:\n"
msgstr ""
"**Ipinapakilala ang instance archiving para sa mga administrator sa IBM "
"Quantum Platform.** Sa update na ito, maaaring i-archive ng mga "
"administrator ang anumang instance sa loob ng kanilang account. Tinitiyak ng"
" pag-archive ng instance na:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Collaborators retain access to results and QPU metrics, properties, and "
"calibrations from past workloads.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nananatiling may access ang mga collaborator sa mga resulta at QPU metric, "
"property, at calibration mula sa mga nakaraang workload.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"No new workloads can be submitted to the archived instance, preventing "
"unintended usage.\n"
msgstr ""
"Walang bagong workload ang maaaring isumite sa archived na instance, na "
"pumipigil sa hindi sinasadyang paggamit.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Archived instances do not subtract anything from your account's plan "
"allocation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga archived na instance ay hindi nagbabawas ng anuman sa plan "
"allocation ng iyong account.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"All archived instances are neatly organized under a dedicated \"Archived\" "
"tab.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lahat ng archived na instance ay maayos na nakaayos sa ilalim ng dedicated "
"na tab na \"Archived\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      - Administrators can reactivate an instance at any time.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"**Previous updates (2025)**\">\n"
msgstr ""
"      - Maaaring i-reactivate ng mga administrator ang isang instance sa anumang oras.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"**Mga nakaraang update (2025)**\">\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"What's new at IBM Quantum - 4Q 2025 {#whats-new-at-ibm-quantum-4q-2025}"
msgstr ""
"Ano ang bago sa IBM Quantum - 4Q 2025 {#whats-new-at-ibm-quantum-4q-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [What's New @ IBM Quantum Q4 "
"2025](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/whats-new-q4-2025) quarterly update "
"is now live!\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang [What's New @ IBM Quantum Q4 "
"2025](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/whats-new-q4-2025) quarterly update "
"ay live na ngayon!\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This convenient wrap-up aims to get you started exploring the latest "
"hardware, software, research, and community events from IBM Quantum and our "
"partner ecosystem.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang maginhawang buod na ito ay naglalayong simulan kang mag-eksplora ng "
"pinakabagong hardware, software, pananaliksik, at mga kaganapan ng komunidad"
" mula sa IBM Quantum at sa aming partner ecosystem.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Highlights include the recently deployed IBM Quantum Nighthawk and IBM "
"Quantum Heron r3 QPUs, a call for submissions to the new open-source Quantum"
" Advantage Tracker, and Qiskit C++, a new project designed to help HPC "
"developers build production-grade quantum-centric supercomputing "
"workflows.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kasama sa mga highlight ang kamakailang na-deploy na IBM Quantum Nighthawk "
"at IBM Quantum Heron r3 QPU, isang panawagan para sa mga pagsusumite sa "
"bagong open-source Quantum Advantage Tracker, at Qiskit C++, isang bagong "
"proyekto na idinisenyo para tulungan ang mga HPC developer na bumuo ng mga "
"production-grade na quantum-centric supercomputing workflow.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "This quarterly update also spotlights notable benchmarks, including:\n"
msgstr ""
"Itinatampok din ng quarterly update na ito ang mga kapansin-pansing "
"benchmark, kabilang ang:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Best EPLG: 0.23% on `ibm_boston` (IBM&reg; Heron r3)\n"
msgstr "Pinakamahusay na EPLG: 0.23% sa `ibm_boston` (IBM&reg; Heron r3)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Best CLOPS: 330K+ across 7 QPUs\n"
msgstr "Pinakamahusay na CLOPS: 330K+ sa 7 QPU\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Total available qubits: 2,477 across 17 QPUs\n"
msgstr "Kabuuang available na qubit: 2,477 sa 17 QPU\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Total papers using IBM Quantum or Qiskit: 5,635\n"
msgstr "Kabuuang papel na gumagamit ng IBM Quantum o Qiskit: 5,635\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Discover these updates and more.](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/whats-"
"new-q4-2025)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Tuklasin ang mga update na ito at marami "
"pa.](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/whats-new-q4-2025)\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compute resources page update – Unified QPU view across regions {#compute-"
"resources-page-update-unified-qpu-view-across-regions}"
msgstr ""
"Update sa pahina ng Mga Compute Resource – Pinag-isang QPU view sa mga "
"rehiyon {#compute-resources-page-update-unified-qpu-view-across-regions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We’ve enhanced the [Compute "
"resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page! New features "
"include the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pinahusay namin ang pahina ng [Mga Compute "
"Resource](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers)! Kasama sa mga bagong "
"feature ang sumusunod:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Unified QPU view** - All QPUs across regions are now displayed in a single"
" table, making it easier to see status and calibrations of the shared fleet "
"across the two regions.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pinag-isang QPU view** - Lahat ng QPU sa iba't ibang rehiyon ay "
"ipinapakita na ngayon sa iisang talahanayan, na nagpapadali sa pagkita ng "
"status at calibration ng shared fleet sa dalawang rehiyon.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Clearer \"Instance Access\" Details** - When viewing a QPU's details, a "
"new Instance access section shows all instances that grant you access to "
"that QPU for the selected account.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mas malinaw na mga detalye ng \"Instance Access\"** - Kapag tinitingnan "
"ang mga detalye ng QPU, ang bagong seksyong Instance access ay nagpapakita "
"ng lahat ng instance na nagbibigay sa iyo ng access sa QPU na iyon para sa "
"napiling account.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can still filter the Compute resources table by region using the funnel "
"icon at the top of the table.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari ka pa ring mag-filter ng talahanayan ng Mga Compute Resource ayon sa "
"rehiyon gamit ang funnel icon sa tuktok ng talahanayan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3 November 2025 {#3-november-2025}"
msgstr "3 Nobyembre 2025 {#3-november-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The quantum computer `ibm_brisbane` has been retired and will no longer "
"accept workload submissions. Any workloads that were already queued on these"
" QPUs might still be processed and return results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang quantum computer na `ibm_brisbane` ay nireretiro na at hindi na "
"tatanggap ng mga pagsumite ng workload. Ang anumang workload na nakapila na "
"sa mga QPU na ito ay maaari pa ring maproseso at magbalik ng mga resulta.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you would like to retrieve job data from important workloads run on this "
"QPU, refer to [these instructions.](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-"
"from-a-retired-qpu)\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung nais mong makuha ang data ng trabaho mula sa mga importanteng workload "
"na pinatakbo sa QPU na ito, sumangguni sa [mga tagubilin na "
"ito.](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "October 2025 {#october-2025}"
msgstr "Oktubre 2025 {#october-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The IBM Quantum fleet welcomes `ibm_fez` and `ibm_marrakesh` to the Open "
"Plan! All users can access these computers as of 27 October.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tinatanggap ng IBM Quantum fleet ang `ibm_fez` at `ibm_marrakesh` sa Open "
"Plan! Maaaring ma-access ng lahat ng user ang mga computer na ito mula 27 "
"Oktubre.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A reminder that `ibm_brisbane` will retire on 3 Nov 2025, so plan your "
"experiments accordingly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Paalala na ang `ibm_brisbane` ay magrerretiro sa 3 Nob 2025, kaya planuhin "
"ang iyong mga eksperimento nang naaangkop.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Learn quantum computing in your own language**: We're excited to announce "
"that translations are now available across all documentation and learning "
"pages on IBM Quantum Platform! Translations have been the most-requested "
"feature in user feedback, and now, quantum learning and development are more"
" accessible than ever.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Matuto ng quantum computing sa iyong sariling wika**: Masaya kaming iulat "
"na available na ngayon ang mga pagsasalin sa lahat ng dokumentasyon at mga "
"pahina ng pag-aaral sa IBM Quantum Platform! Ang mga pagsasalin ay ang "
"pinaka-hiniling na feature sa feedback ng mga user, at ngayon, mas "
"accessible na kaysa kailanman ang quantum learning at development.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Translations of **tutorials, courses, documentation, and announcements** are"
" now available in seven languages: French, German, Italian, Japanese, "
"Korean, Portuguese, and Spanish.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga pagsasalin ng **mga tutorial, kurso, dokumentasyon, at anunsyo** ay "
"available na ngayon sa pitong wika: Pranses, Aleman, Italyano, Hapon, "
"Koreano, Portuges, at Espanyol.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Multilingual search**: Use the search bar to find what you need in your "
"preferred language.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Multilingual na paghahanap**: Gamitin ang search bar para mahanap ang "
"kailangan mo sa iyong nais na wika.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Downloadable resources**: Download resources such as guides or tutorials "
"in the language that suits you best.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mga nada-download na resource**: I-download ang mga resource tulad ng mga "
"gabay o tutorial sa wikang pinaka-angkop sa iyo.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Localized API references**: Explore the latest version of the API "
"reference and REST APIs with fully translated documentation (current "
"versions only).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mga naka-localize na API reference**: Tuklasin ang pinakabagong bersyon ng"
" API reference at REST API na may ganap na isinalin na dokumentasyon "
"(kasalukuyang mga bersyon lamang).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Error messages & solutions**: Understand issues faster with translated "
"error codes and suggested solutions.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mga mensahe ng error at solusyon**: Mas mabilis na maunawaan ang mga isyu "
"gamit ang mga isinalin na error code at mga mungkahing solusyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Find a translation error? Let us know! [Submit a translation "
"issue](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation/issues/new?template=translations.yaml)"
" in our GitHub repo.\n"
msgstr ""
"  May nahanap na error sa pagsasalin? Ipaalam sa amin! [Mag-submit ng isyu "
"sa "
"pagsasalin](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation/issues/new?template=translations.yaml)"
" sa aming GitHub repo.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  *Note that there is a processing delay between the publication of new "
"content and its translation, so you might only see the English version of "
"recently released content for a few days while the translation is "
"underway.*\n"
msgstr ""
"  *Tandaan na may processing delay sa pagitan ng paglalathala ng bagong "
"nilalaman at ng pagsasalin nito, kaya maaaring makita mo lamang ang bersyong"
" Ingles ng kamakailan lang na inilabas na nilalaman sa loob ng ilang araw "
"habang isinasagawa ang pagsasalin.*\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Learning in IBM Quantum Platform** now has an updated home page to help "
"you navigate the educational resources available, as well as two new catalog"
" pages to help browse courses and modules. [Check out the "
"updates!](/learning)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Ang Learning sa IBM Quantum Platform** ay may na-update na home page na "
"ngayon para matulungan kang mag-navigate sa mga available na educational "
"resource, pati na rin ang dalawang bagong catalog page para makapag-browse "
"ng mga kurso at module. [Tingnan ang mga update!](/learning)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "15 September 2025 {#15-september-2025}"
msgstr "15 Setyembre 2025 {#15-september-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [Unitary Foundation Quantum Open Source Software "
"survey](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25) helps capture the needs and "
"concerns of anyone who works with quantum software - including you! The "
"survey results provide valuable feedback for our team of Qiskit developers, "
"and helps us to understand the broader quantum software landscape.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang [Unitary Foundation Quantum Open Source Software "
"survey](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25) ay tumutulong na makuha ang "
"mga pangangailangan at alalahanin ng sinumang nagtatrabaho sa quantum "
"software — kabilang ka! Ang mga resulta ng survey ay nagbibigay ng "
"mahalagang feedback para sa aming koponan ng mga Qiskit developer, at "
"tumutulong sa amin na maunawaan ang mas malawak na landscape ng quantum "
"software.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have a few minutes, please share the link or consider filling it out "
"today! The survey is open through 3 October 2025.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung mayroon kang ilang minuto, mangyaring ibahagi ang link o isaalang-alang"
" na punan ito ngayon! Ang survey ay bukas hanggang 3 Oktubre 2025.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25)\n"
msgstr ""
"[http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1 September 2025 {#1-september-2025}"
msgstr "1 Setyembre 2025 {#1-september-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We plan to retire `ibm_brisbane` on or around 1 November 2025.\n"
msgstr ""
"Plano naming ireretiro ang `ibm_brisbane` sa o kalapit ng 1 Nobyembre "
"2025.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Once this QPU is retired, it will no longer accept jobs. If any jobs are "
"queued on the QPU at the time of its retirement, they will still run and "
"return results. Please plan your experiments accordingly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kapag nireretiro ang QPU na ito, hindi na ito tatanggap ng mga trabaho. Kung"
" mayroon mang mga trabahong nakapila sa QPU sa oras ng pagreretiro nito, "
"patuloy itong tatakbo at magbabalik ng mga resulta. Mangyaring planuhin ang "
"iyong mga eksperimento nang naaangkop.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "31 July 2025 {#31-july-2025}"
msgstr "31 Hulyo 2025 {#31-july-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Today, we are thrilled to announce the launch of ibm_pittsburgh, our first "
"quantum computer powered by the new Heron Revision 3 (r3) QPU, and located "
"in our Poughkeepsie quantum datacenter. r3 is the result of targeted "
"improvements that directly impact coherence, gate fidelity, and readout "
"performance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ngayon, masaya kaming iulat ang paglulunsad ng ibm_pittsburgh, ang aming "
"unang quantum computer na pinapatakbo ng bagong Heron Revision 3 (r3) QPU, "
"at matatagpuan sa aming Poughkeepsie quantum datacenter. Ang r3 ay resulta "
"ng mga naka-target na pagpapabuti na direktang nakakaapekto sa coherence, "
"gate fidelity, at readout performance.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The results speak for themselves, including an industry-leading ~350 us of "
"T2 coherence; see the [latest metrics on "
"Pittsburgh](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_pittsburgh) "
"on IBM Quantum Platform. This steady, measured progress is at the center of "
"our strategy for delivering reliable and performant quantum computing.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kitang-kita na sa mga resulta ang pagbuti, kabilang ang isang industry-"
"leading na ~350 us ng T2 coherence; tingnan ang [pinakabagong mga sukatan sa"
" Pittsburgh](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_pittsburgh) "
"sa IBM Quantum Platform. Ang matatag at maingat na progresong ito ay nasa "
"sentro ng aming estratehiya para makapaghatid ng maaasahan at performant na "
"quantum computing.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As recently announced, today we retire one of our Eagle processors, "
"ibm_sherbrooke. We invite you to migrate to our quantum computers powered by"
" Heron processors, to take advantage of the lower error rates (approximately"
" 5x lower EPLG) and faster gates (nearly 8x faster), leading to more "
"performant circuits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tulad ng kamakailang inanunsyo, ngayon ay inireretiro namin ang isa sa aming"
" mga Eagle processor, ang ibm_sherbrooke. Inaanyayahan ka naming lumipat sa "
"aming mga quantum computer na pinapatakbo ng mga Heron processor, para "
"samantalahin ang mas mababang mga rate ng error (humigit-kumulang 5x mas "
"mababang EPLG) at mas mabilis na mga gate (halos 8x mas mabilis), na "
"humahantong sa mas performant na mga circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Together, let’s open the door to more complex algorithmic exploration and "
"real-world applications.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sama-sama, buksan natin ang pintuan sa mas kumplikadong algorithmic na "
"eksplorasyon at mga real-world na aplikasyon.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "24 July 2025 {#24-july-2025}"
msgstr "24 Hulyo 2025 {#24-july-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Quantum technology is advancing rapidly, and it can be challenging to keep "
"up. To help you stay in the loop, we’ve put together a roundup featuring the"
" newest tools, performance improvements, and updates from IBM Quantum. It "
"includes links to code examples, documentation, and research to help you get"
" the most out of our latest developments.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mabilis na umuusad ang teknolohiya ng quantum, at maaaring maging hamon na "
"makasabay. Para matulungan kang manatiling updated, naghanda kami ng roundup"
" na nagtatampok ng pinakabagong mga tool, mga pagpapabuti sa performance, at"
" mga update mula sa IBM Quantum. Kasama dito ang mga link sa mga halimbawa "
"ng code, dokumentasyon, at pananaliksik para matulungan kang mapakinabangan "
"nang husto ang aming pinakabagong mga pag-unlad.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Learn what's new at IBM Quantum](https://ibm.biz/whats-new-at-ibm-"
"quantum-h1-2025-op)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Alamin ang bago sa IBM Quantum](https://ibm.biz/whats-new-at-ibm-"
"quantum-h1-2025-op)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "27 June 2025 {#27-june-2025}"
msgstr "27 Hunyo 2025 {#27-june-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`ibm_sherbrooke` will now retire on or around 28 July 2025.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang `ibm_sherbrooke` ay magrerretiro na ngayon sa o kalapit ng 28 Hulyo "
"2025.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Be sure to retrieve any job data from important past jobs before it is "
"retired.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tiyaking makuha ang anumang data ng trabaho mula sa mga importanteng "
"nakaraang trabaho bago ito ireretiro.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "24 June 2025 {#24-june-2025}"
msgstr "24 Hunyo 2025 {#24-june-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Profile page: Now you can find integrated profile details directly in the "
"new platform. Find your profile by clicking on the user icon in the top "
"right or visiting your [profile "
"page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/profile).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pahina ng Profile: Makakahanap ka na ngayon ng mga integrated na detalye ng "
"profile direkta sa bagong platform. Hanapin ang iyong profile sa pamamagitan"
" ng pag-click sa user icon sa kanang itaas o pagbisita sa iyong [pahina ng "
"profile](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/profile).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Public backends: View a list of US backends without logging in, available on"
" the updated [Compute Resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) "
"page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mga pampublikong backend: Tingnan ang listahan ng mga US backend nang hindi "
"nag-log in, available sa na-update na pahina ng [Mga Compute "
"Resource](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Learning: Quantum computing courses have now been released in the upgraded "
"platform, along with new educational modules designed to help teachers bring"
" Qiskit into their classrooms. This is the first step towards migrating IBM "
"Quantum Learning to the new platform, with more resources to be released in "
"the coming weeks. Resources can be accessed without needing to log in at "
"[IBM Quantum Learning](/learning). Check out new and updated content, "
"including [Quantum diagonalization algorithms](/learning/courses/quantum-"
"diagonalization-algorithms), [Quantum computing in "
"practice](/learning/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice), and Qiskit in "
"Classrooms modules like [Quantum mechanics](/learning/modules/quantum-"
"mechanics) and [Computer science](/learning/modules/computer-science).\n"
msgstr ""
"Learning: Ang mga kurso sa quantum computing ay inilabas na ngayon sa na-"
"upgrade na platform, kasama ang mga bagong educational module na idinisenyo "
"para tulungan ang mga guro na dalhin ang Qiskit sa kanilang mga silid-"
"aralan. Ito ang unang hakbang patungo sa paglipat ng IBM Quantum Learning sa"
" bagong platform, na may mas maraming resource na ilalabas sa mga darating "
"na linggo. Maaaring ma-access ang mga resource nang hindi kailangang mag-log"
" in sa [IBM Quantum Learning](/learning). Tingnan ang bago at na-update na "
"nilalaman, kabilang ang [Mga quantum diagonalization "
"algorithm](/learning/courses/quantum-diagonalization-algorithms), [Quantum "
"computing sa praktis](/learning/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice), at "
"mga Qiskit in Classrooms module tulad ng [Quantum "
"mechanics](/learning/modules/quantum-mechanics) at [Computer "
"science](/learning/modules/computer-science).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Quantum Composer: The circuit-building "
"[Composer](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/composer) has now been migrated to "
"the new platform. The experience is largely the same, except for files will "
"no longer be stored in the platform, and will need to be downloaded locally."
" Find more details in the [Composer documentation](/guides/composer).\n"
msgstr ""
"IBM Quantum Composer: Ang circuit-building na "
"[Composer](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/composer) ay inilipat na ngayon sa "
"bagong platform. Karaniwang pareho ang karanasan, maliban na ang mga file ay"
" hindi na maitatago sa platform, at kailangan itong i-download nang lokal. "
"Hanapin ang karagdagang detalye sa [dokumentasyon ng "
"Composer](/guides/composer).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Announcements: Now you can access news, software updates, and service alerts"
" on the new platform. Click the bell icon in the top navigation bar or the "
"link under Featured resources on the [home "
"page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) to visit the new Announcements page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mga Anunsyo: Maaari ka na ngayong ma-access ang mga balita, software update,"
" at alerto sa serbisyo sa bagong platform. I-click ang icon ng kampana sa "
"tuktok na navigation bar o ang link sa ilalim ng Featured resources sa [home"
" page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) para bisitahin ang bagong pahina ng "
"Mga Anunsyo.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "5 June 2025 {#5-june-2025}"
msgstr "5 Hunyo 2025 {#5-june-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Added instance job filter: The platform now displays only your workloads by "
"default. On the dashboard, you will see only the latest workloads you have "
"submitted to instances within your account.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nagdagdag ng instance job filter: Ang platform ay nagpapakita na ngayon ng "
"iyong mga workload lamang bilang default. Sa dashboard, makikita mo lamang "
"ang mga pinakabagong workload na iyong isinumite sa mga instance sa loob ng "
"iyong account.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Only the latest workloads now shown by "
"default](/docs/images/guides/latest-updates/workloads.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Ang pinakabagong mga workload lamang ang ipinapakita bilang "
"default](/docs/images/guides/latest-updates/workloads.avif)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "A new qiskit-ibm-runtime release, featuring:\n"
msgstr "Isang bagong qiskit-ibm-runtime release, na nagtatampok ng:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Support for private jobs for developers of Qiskit Functions\n"
msgstr ""
"Suporta para sa mga private job para sa mga developer ng Qiskit Function\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A new channel for the platform that makes instance selection optional, which"
" simplifies account setup and backend access by automatically checking all "
"available instances. This update benefits users who manage multiple "
"instances or prefer a streamlined workflow without specifying instance "
"details each time. Developers and researchers working across various "
"projects with different levels of access and multiple backends will find "
"this especially helpful.\n"
msgstr ""
"Isang bagong channel para sa platform na ginagawang opsyonal ang pagpili ng "
"instance, na nagpapadali ng account setup at backend access sa pamamagitan "
"ng awtomatikong pagsuri ng lahat ng available na instance. Nakikinabang sa "
"update na ito ang mga user na namamahala ng maraming instance o mas gustong "
"gumamit ng streamlined na workflow nang hindi kinakailangang tukuyin ang mga"
" detalye ng instance sa bawat pagkakataon. Ang mga developer at mananaliksik"
" na nagtatrabaho sa iba't ibang proyekto na may iba't ibang antas ng access "
"at maraming backend ay makakahanap ng partikular na benepisyo dito.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "15 May 2025 {#15-may-2025}"
msgstr "15 Mayo 2025 {#15-may-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Note: This is relevant to IBM Quantum Platform Classic (at "
"https://quantum.ibm.com/) only.*\n"
msgstr ""
"*Tandaan: Ito ay may kaugnayan sa IBM Quantum Platform Classic (sa "
"https://quantum.ibm.com/) lamang.*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are still using [IBM Quantum Platform "
"Classic](https://quantum.ibm.com/) at https://quantum.ibm.com, please note "
"that it will no longer be accessible starting 1 July 2025. At that time, "
"Open Plan access will only be available on the [new "
"Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), and you will no longer have "
"access to this platform or its data. Download your data and migrate to the "
"new platform as soon as possible to avoid interruptions in your work. See "
"the migration guide for more details.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung gumagamit ka pa rin ng [IBM Quantum Platform "
"Classic](https://quantum.ibm.com/) sa https://quantum.ibm.com, pakitandaan "
"na hindi na ito magiging accessible simula 1 Hulyo 2025. Sa oras na iyon, "
"ang Open Plan access ay available lamang sa [bagong "
"Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), at hindi ka na magkakaroon ng "
"access sa platform na ito o sa data nito. I-download ang iyong data at "
"lumipat sa bagong platform sa lalong madaling panahon para maiwasan ang mga "
"pagkaantala sa iyong trabaho. Tingnan ang migration guide para sa "
"karagdagang detalye.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Users of other plans (for example, Premium Plan or On-Prem Plan) should wait"
" for specific instructions from their administrators before migrating.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga user ng ibang plan (halimbawa, Premium Plan o On-Prem Plan) ay dapat"
" hintayin ang mga tiyak na tagubilin mula sa kanilang mga administrator bago"
" lumipat.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "8 May 2025 {#8-may-2025}"
msgstr "8 Mayo 2025 {#8-may-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Flex Plan](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/flex-plan), a new resource "
"consumption offering, has been released.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Flex Plan](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/flex-plan), isang bagong alok "
"sa pagkonsumo ng resource, ay inilabas na.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Tutorials](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) are now available on the"
" platform to help users with use-case exploration.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga [Tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) ay available na "
"ngayon sa platform para tulungan ang mga user sa pag-explore ng mga use "
"case.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [Qiskit Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) has "
"launched on the platform.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang [Qiskit Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) ay "
"inilunsad na sa platform.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Updated Session OpenAPI schema: `backend_name` field is now nullable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Na-update na OpenAPI schema ng Session: Ang field na `backend_name` ay "
"nullable na ngayon.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "24 April 2025 {#24-april-2025}"
msgstr "24 Abril 2025 {#24-april-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Instance limits: Individuals can view [available time and "
"usage](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), which displays alerts when "
"approaching limits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mga limitasyon ng instance: Maaaring tingnan ng mga indibidwal ang "
"[available na oras at paggamit](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), na"
" nagpapakita ng mga alerto kapag papalapit na sa mga limitasyon.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Administrator permissions: Administrators can view overall usage, cycle "
"period, and remaining time per plan in the Instances page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mga pahintulot ng administrator: Maaaring tingnan ng mga administrator ang "
"kabuuang paggamit, cycle period, at natitirang oras bawat plan sa pahina ng "
"Mga Instance.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Search: Search is now integrated and available for filtering documentation "
"content, including guides and API references.\n"
msgstr ""
"Paghahanap: Ang paghahanap ay integrated na ngayon at available para sa pag-"
"filter ng nilalaman ng dokumentasyon, kabilang ang mga gabay at API "
"reference.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Billing: Pay-As-You-Go users can find a link to billing by clicking the "
"overflow menu for each instance on the "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Billing: Ang mga user ng Pay-As-You-Go ay makakakita ng link sa billing sa "
"pamamagitan ng pag-click sa overflow menu para sa bawat instance sa pahina "
"ng [Mga Instance](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"New sign-in option: Sign-in with Google is now available on the [sign-in "
"page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/signin).\n"
msgstr ""
"Bagong opsyon sa pag-sign in: Ang pag-sign in gamit ang Google ay available "
"na ngayon sa [pahina ng pag-sign "
"in](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/signin).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Bug fixes:\n"
msgstr "Mga pag-aayos ng bug:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Addressed failed batch sessions for Open Plan users.\n"
msgstr ""
"Natugunan ang mga pumalyang batch session para sa mga user ng Open Plan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Addressed batch sessions not closing properly.\n"
msgstr "Natugunan ang mga batch session na hindi wastong nagsasara.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Improved platform stability by improving error handling and better "
"recovery.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pinahusay ang katatagan ng platform sa pamamagitan ng pagpapabuti ng "
"paghawak ng error at mas mahusay na pagbawi.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Addressed an issue that prevented QPU metrics to be displayed for the QPUs "
"in the eu-de region.\n"
msgstr ""
"Natugunan ang isyu na pumipigil sa pagpapakita ng mga QPU metric para sa mga"
" QPU sa rehiyon ng eu-de.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Deprecation reminder: The deprecation date for IBM Quantum Platform Classic "
"has been set for 1 July 2025.\n"
msgstr ""
"Paalala ng deprecation: Ang petsa ng deprecation para sa IBM Quantum "
"Platform Classic ay itinakda para sa 1 Hulyo 2025.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "21 April 2025 {#21-april-2025}"
msgstr "21 Abril 2025 {#21-april-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`ibm_kyiv` has been retired and will no longer accept workload submissions. "
"Any workloads that were already queued on these QPUs might still be "
"processed and return results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang `ibm_kyiv` ay nireretiro na at hindi na tatanggap ng mga pagsumite ng "
"workload. Ang anumang workload na nakapila na sa mga QPU na ito ay maaari pa"
" ring maproseso at magbalik ng mga resulta.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "10 April 2025 {#10-april-2025}"
msgstr "10 Abril 2025 {#10-april-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Updated navigation to remove duplicated pages:\n"
msgstr "Na-update na navigation para alisin ang mga duplicate na pahina:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Administration section has been renamed \"Access management\" and now "
"only focuses on managing users and access groups.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang seksyong Administration ay pinalitan ng pangalan na \"Access "
"management\" at nakatuon na ngayon sa pamamahala ng mga user at access "
"group.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There is only one page each for managing instances and workloads; there are "
"no longer separate pages for each in the Administration section.  Instead, "
"what you can view and manage on each page is dependent on your access and "
"permissions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mayroon lamang isang pahina para sa pamamahala ng mga instance at workload; "
"wala nang mga hiwalay na pahina para sa bawat isa sa seksyong "
"Administration. Sa halip, ang maaari mong tingnan at pamahalaan sa bawat "
"pahina ay nakasalalay sa iyong access at mga pahintulot.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The analytics page (visible only to those with certain access) has been "
"moved into the main navigation menu, to make it easier to find.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang pahina ng analytics (nakikita lamang ng mga may ilang access) ay "
"inilipat sa pangunahing navigation menu, para mas madaling mahanap.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Launched two new QPUs: ibm_aachen (eu-de region) and ibm_kingston (us-east "
"region)\n"
msgstr ""
"Naglunsad ng dalawang bagong QPU: ibm_aachen (rehiyon ng eu-de) at "
"ibm_kingston (rehiyon ng us-east)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Individuals who can view the analytics page can now filter the data to view "
"information per plan.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga indibidwal na maaaring tingnan ang pahina ng analytics ay maaari na "
"ngayong mag-filter ng data para makita ang impormasyon bawat plan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Administrators can now more easily add multiple individuals to an access "
"group due to the addition of an existing account members table.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mas madali na ngayong magdagdag ng maraming indibidwal sa isang access group"
" para sa mga administrator dahil sa pagdaragdag ng talahanayan ng mga "
"kasalukuyang miyembro ng account.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Premium plan instance administrators can set the instance allocation as a "
"usage limit, so that usage in those instances cannot exceed the time "
"alloted. See the [Set instance allocation limits](/guides/allocation-limits)"
" guide for instructions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaaring itakda ng mga administrator ng Premium plan instance ang instance "
"allocation bilang limitasyon sa paggamit, para ang paggamit sa mga instance "
"na iyon ay hindi lalampas sa alloted na oras. Tingnan ang gabay na [Magtakda"
" ng mga limitasyon sa instance allocation](/guides/allocation-limits) para "
"sa mga tagubilin.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that the sunset date for IBM Quantum Platform Classic has been set for "
"1 July 2025.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tandaan na ang petsa ng pagtatapos para sa IBM Quantum Platform Classic ay "
"itinakda para sa 1 Hulyo 2025.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "9 April 2025 {#9-april-2025}"
msgstr "9 Abril 2025 {#9-april-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Two new 156Q Heron R2 QPUs, "
"[ibm_aachen](https://quantum.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen), located "
"in the EU region, and "
"[ibm_kingston](https://quantum.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_kingston), "
"located in the US region, are now available.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalawang bagong 156Q Heron R2 QPU, ang "
"[ibm_aachen](https://quantum.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen), na "
"matatagpuan sa rehiyon ng EU, at ang "
"[ibm_kingston](https://quantum.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_kingston), na "
"matatagpuan sa rehiyon ng US, ay available na ngayon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"View the systems you have access to with your selected instance in the "
"[Compute resources](https://quantum.ibm.com/services/resources) page on IBM "
"Quantum Platform.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tingnan ang mga sistema na may access ka gamit ang iyong napiling instance "
"sa pahina ng [Mga Compute "
"Resource](https://quantum.ibm.com/services/resources) sa IBM Quantum "
"Platform.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "27 March 2025 {#27-march-2025}"
msgstr "27 Marso 2025 {#27-march-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Cost limits for Pay-As-You-Go Plan** - Pay-As-You-Go Plan users with "
"sufficient access can now view and edit [maximum cost "
"limits](/guides/manage-cost#cost-limit) for their instances.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mga limitasyon ng gastos para sa Pay-As-You-Go Plan** - Ang mga user ng "
"Pay-As-You-Go Plan na may sapat na access ay maaari na ngayong tingnan at "
"i-edit ang [mga maximum na limitasyon ng gastos](/guides/manage-cost#cost-"
"limit) para sa kanilang mga instance.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Job management updates** - Now only administrators can delete workloads "
"created by other users in an account, and collaborators will only be able to"
" delete their own workloads.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mga update sa pamamahala ng trabaho** - Ang mga administrator lamang "
"ngayon ang maaaring mag-delete ng mga workload na nilikha ng ibang mga user "
"sa isang account, at ang mga collaborator ay makakapag-delete lamang ng "
"kanilang sariling mga workload.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Updated authentication error messages** - Error messaging has been "
"improved for account and authentication processes to reduce issues with "
"signup flow. The [Support page](/guides/support) has been expanded with "
"recommendations for troubleshooting and resolving common errors.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mga na-update na mensahe ng error sa authentication** - Pinahusay ang mga "
"mensahe ng error para sa mga proseso ng account at authentication para "
"mabawasan ang mga isyu sa signup flow. Ang [pahina ng "
"Suporta](/guides/support) ay pinalawak na may mga rekomendasyon para sa pag-"
"troubleshoot at paglutas ng mga karaniwang error.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Increased default data retention** - The default data retention period for"
" the new IBM Quantum Platform has been increased to three years, up from one"
" year on IBM Quantum Platform Classic.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pinahabang default na panahon ng pag-iingat ng data** - Ang default na "
"panahon ng pag-iingat ng data para sa bagong IBM Quantum Platform ay "
"pinalawak sa tatlong taon, mula sa isang taon sa IBM Quantum Platform "
"Classic.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Resolved inconsistent behavior due to caching** - Some inconsistent "
"behavior seen when updating instance limits, tags, and QPU resources has "
"been resolved, which was due to caching.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Nalutas ang hindi pare-parehong gawi dahil sa caching** - Ang ilang hindi "
"pare-parehong gawi na nakikita kapag ina-update ang mga limitasyon ng "
"instance, tag, at QPU resource ay nalutas na, na sanhi ng caching.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For full details on the early access release and upcoming improvements, "
"[check out the blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/iqp-upgrade).\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa buong detalye sa early access release at mga paparating na "
"pagpapabuti, [tingnan ang blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/iqp-"
"upgrade).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "25 March 2025 {#25-march-2025}"
msgstr "25 Marso 2025 {#25-march-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An IBM Quantum Network exclusive: Join us for our first quarterly IBM "
"Quantum Product Updates Webinar, a series in which we unveil the latest "
"advancements in our products and offerings, showcase partner use cases, and "
"provide the opportunity for Q&A with quantum experts.\n"
msgstr ""
"Eksklusibo sa IBM Quantum Network: Samahan kami sa aming unang quarterly IBM"
" Quantum Product Updates Webinar, isang serye kung saan inilalabas namin ang"
" pinakabagong mga pag-unlad sa aming mga produkto at alok, nagtatampok ng "
"mga use case ng partner, at nagbibigay ng pagkakataon para sa Q&A kasama ang"
" mga eksperto sa quantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the first segment, we will talk about the evolution coming to IBM Quantum"
" Platform that is designed to enhance security, stability, and user "
"experience. Our team will walk through the key updates, demonstrate new "
"capabilities, and discuss how these improvements empower developers and "
"users alike.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa unang segment, tatalakayin namin ang ebolusyong darating sa IBM Quantum "
"Platform na idinisenyo para mapahusay ang seguridad, katatagan, at karanasan"
" ng user. Ang aming koponan ay magbibigay ng walk-through ng mga pangunahing"
" update, magpapakita ng mga bagong kakayahan, at tatalakayin kung paano ang "
"mga pagpapabuting ito ay nagpapalakas sa mga developer at user.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The second segment will feature the launch of three new and innovative "
"Qiskit Functions in the Qiskit Functions Catalog. Each function provider "
"will present their solution, highlighting its unique features, use cases, "
"and impact on the broader ecosystem. Attendees will gain firsthand insights "
"into how these Qiskit Functions can be leveraged for real-world "
"applications.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang pangalawang segment ay magtatampok ng paglulunsad ng tatlong bago at "
"makabagong Qiskit Function sa Qiskit Functions Catalog. Ipapakita ng bawat "
"function provider ang kanilang solusyon, na itinatatampok ang mga "
"natatanging feature nito, mga use case, at epekto sa mas malawak na "
"ecosystem. Makakakuha ang mga kalahok ng direktang mga kaalaman kung paano "
"maaaring gamitin ang mga Qiskit Function na ito para sa mga real-world na "
"aplikasyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Learn more and register "
"today](https://www.ibm.com/events/reg/flow/ibm/m1ok6zmb/landing/page/landing)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Matuto nang higit pa at mag-register "
"ngayon](https://www.ibm.com/events/reg/flow/ibm/m1ok6zmb/landing/page/landing)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "26 February 2025 {#26-february-2025}"
msgstr "26 Pebrero 2025 {#26-february-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Today, we are releasing an early access version of the upgraded experience, "
"and invite you to [open an account and explore the new "
"interface](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). We will continue to roll out "
"updates over the coming months, with the end goal of creating an experience "
"that looks and feels like the classic version of IBM Quantum Platform, but "
"with greater functionality. We will eventually sunset IBM Quantum Platform "
"classic, so stay tuned for updates.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ngayon, naglalabas kami ng early access na bersyon ng na-upgrade na "
"karanasan, at inaanyayahan ka naming [magbukas ng account at tuklasin ang "
"bagong interface](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). Patuloy kaming maglalabas "
"ng mga update sa mga darating na buwan, na ang layunin ay lumikha ng "
"karanasan na magmukhang katulad ng klasikong bersyon ng IBM Quantum "
"Platform, ngunit may mas malawak na functionality. Sa kalaunan ay ititigil "
"namin ang IBM Quantum Platform classic, kaya abangan ang mga update.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Please note: If your IBM Quantum Platform access falls under a plan "
"administrator (Premium Plan, On-Prem Plan, Startup Program, etc.), you will "
"receive guided migration support through your administrator in the coming "
"months. In the meantime, you are welcome to [create a free Open Plan account"
" to explore the new platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pakitandaan: Kung ang iyong access sa IBM Quantum Platform ay nasa ilalim ng"
" isang plan administrator (Premium Plan, On-Prem Plan, Startup Program, "
"atbp.), makakatanggap ka ng guided migration support mula sa iyong "
"administrator sa mga darating na buwan. Sa samantala, malugod kang "
"makakalikha ng [libreng Open Plan account para tuklasin ang bagong "
"platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "24 February 2025 {#24-february-2025}"
msgstr "24 Pebrero 2025 {#24-february-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Our inventory is getting a makeover, and we will be retiring the following "
"QPUs on or around 18 April 2025:\n"
msgstr ""
"Nagbabago ang aming imbentaryo, at ireretiro namin ang mga sumusunod na QPU "
"sa o kalapit ng 18 Abril 2025:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "ibm_kyiv\n"
msgstr "ibm_kyiv\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"~ibm_sherbrooke~ UPDATE: ibm_sherbrooke will stay active for several more "
"weeks after 18 April 2025.\n"
msgstr ""
"~ibm_sherbrooke~ UPDATE: Ang ibm_sherbrooke ay mananatiling aktibo sa loob "
"ng ilang higit pang linggo pagkatapos ng 18 Abril 2025.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Be sure to retrieve any job data from important past jobs before these QPUs are retired.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"Tiyaking makuha ang anumang data ng trabaho mula sa mga importanteng nakaraang trabaho bago ireretiro ang mga QPU na ito.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"latest-qiskit-sdk\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"latest-qiskit-sdk\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit SDK v2.3 {#qiskit-sdk-v23}"
msgstr "Qiskit SDK v2.3 {#qiskit-sdk-v23}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "January 2026 {#january-2026}"
msgstr "Enero 2026 {#january-2026}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Building on the momentum established across the v2.x series, which has "
"centered on positioning Qiskit as the leading platform for hybrid quantum-"
"HPC workflows, [Qiskit SDK "
"v2.3](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-2-3-release-summary) delivers "
"a significant expansion of the C API alongside faster, more flexible tools "
"for building and optimizing quantum circuits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Batay sa momentum na naitatag sa buong serye ng v2.x, na nakatuon sa "
"pagpoposisyon ng Qiskit bilang nangungunang platform para sa mga hybrid "
"quantum-HPC workflow, ang [Qiskit SDK "
"v2.3](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-2-3-release-summary) ay "
"naghahatid ng malaking pagpapalawak ng C API kasabay ng mas mabilis at mas "
"nababaluktot na mga tool para sa pagbuo at pag-optimize ng mga quantum "
"circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  Major updates include:\n"
msgstr "  Kasama sa mga pangunahing update ang:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Custom transpiler passes in C** - Write custom transpiler passes through "
"Qiskit's C API using the new `QkDag` object and an expanded `QkTarget` "
"object, which enable step-by-step inspection, modification, and extension of"
" the compilation process - without rebuilding the entire compiler "
"pipeline.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mga custom na transpiler pass sa C** - Sumulat ng mga custom na transpiler"
" pass sa pamamagitan ng C API ng Qiskit gamit ang bagong object na `QkDag` "
"at pinalawak na object na `QkTarget`, na nagbibigay-daan sa sunud-sunod na "
"inspeksyon, pagbabago, at pagpapalawak ng proseso ng compilation — nang "
"hindi kailangang muling itayo ang buong compiler pipeline.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Faster hardware layout selection** - Upgrades and Rust-driven performance "
"enhancements to `VF2Layout` and `VF2PostLayout` improve the speed and "
"scalability of circuit-to-hardware layout selection, reducing compilation "
"overhead and improving fidelity on quantum hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mas mabilis na pagpili ng hardware layout** - Mga upgrade at Rust-driven "
"na mga pagpapahusay sa performance para sa `VF2Layout` at `VF2PostLayout` na"
" nagpapabuti ng bilis at scalability ng pagpili ng circuit-to-hardware "
"layout, na nagbabawas ng compilation overhead at nagpapabuti ng fidelity sa "
"quantum hardware.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**New multi-qubit Pauli measurement** - The new `PauliProductMeasurement` "
"instruction enables joint projective measurement across multiple qubits in a"
" single operation, unlocking compilation to Pauli-based computation - a "
"common representation in fault-tolerant quantum computing.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Bagong multi-qubit Pauli measurement** - Ang bagong instruksyong "
"`PauliProductMeasurement` ay nagbibigay-daan sa joint projective measurement"
" sa maraming qubit sa iisang operasyon, na nagbubukas ng compilation sa "
"Pauli-based computation — isang karaniwang representasyon sa fault-tolerant "
"quantum computing.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Improvements in early fault-tolerant transpilation** - Performance and "
"feature enhancements for transpilation to early fault-tolerant targets - "
"especially Clifford+T targets - help users more efficiently build "
"transpilation pipelines for future QPUs.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mga pagpapabuti sa maagang fault-tolerant transpilation** - Mga "
"pagpapahusay sa performance at feature para sa transpilation sa mga maagang "
"fault-tolerant na target — lalo na ang mga Clifford+T target — na tumutulong"
" sa mga user na mas mahusay na bumuo ng mga transpilation pipeline para sa "
"mga hinaharap na QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  These capabilities give developers greater flexibility to customize "
"quantum circuit optimizations and integrate with existing HPC workflows. "
"[Visit the blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-2-3-release-"
"summary) for the full technical summary.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Ang mga kakayahang ito ay nagbibigay sa mga developer ng mas malawak na "
"flexibility para i-customize ang mga pag-optimize ng quantum circuit at "
"i-integrate sa mga kasalukuyang HPC workflow. [Bisitahin ang "
"blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-2-3-release-summary) para sa "
"buong teknikal na buod.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Wondering what has changed? Read the "
"[changelog](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/releases/tag/2.3.0) and the "
"[v2.3 release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/release-"
"notes/2.3).\n"
msgstr ""
"Gusto mong malaman kung ano ang nagbago? Basahin ang "
"[changelog](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/releases/tag/2.3.0) at ang [mga"
" release note ng v2.3](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/release-"
"notes/2.3).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/* use url format /api/qiskit/release-notes/X.X to link to the specific X.X"
" version of the release notes */}\n"
msgstr ""
"{/* use url format /api/qiskit/release-notes/X.X to link to the specific X.X"
" version of the release notes */}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*To see the release notes for all versions, visit the [Qiskit SDK release "
"notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/release-notes).*\n"
msgstr ""
"*Para makita ang mga release note para sa lahat ng bersyon, bisitahin ang "
"[mga release note ng Qiskit "
"SDK](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/release-notes).*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"latest-qiskit-runtime\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"latest-qiskit-runtime\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Runtime client 0.46.0 {#qiskit-runtime-client-0460}"
msgstr "Qiskit Runtime client 0.46.0 {#qiskit-runtime-client-0460}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "April 2026 {#april-2026}"
msgstr "Abril 2026 {#april-2026}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"executor-primitive\"></span>\n"
"- **Introducing the Executor primitive**: We're excited to announce the release of the new `Executor` primitive and a new version of the noise-learning helper class, `NoiseLearnerV3`, both of which were first previewed at QDC 2025.\n"
msgstr ""
"<span id=\"executor-primitive\"></span>\n"
"- **Ipinapakilala ang Executor primitive**: Masaya kaming iulat ang paglabas ng bagong primitive na `Executor` at isang bagong bersyon ng noise-learning helper class na `NoiseLearnerV3`, na parehong unang na-preview sa QDC 2025.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Together with "
"[Samplomatic](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/index.html), they make up"
" the [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model), which "
"provides full transparency and control to fine-tune your error mitigation "
"workflow. The [Probabilistic error cancellation with shaded "
"lightcones](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-"
"slc/tutorials/01_getting_started.html) tutorial, for example, demonstrates "
"how this model is used to combine advanced techniques, including shaded "
"lightcones, probabilistic error cancellation (PEC), Twirled Readout Error "
"eXtinction (TREX), and [measurement-based postselection](/guides/post-"
"selection), to further improve the result quality.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Kasama ng [Samplomatic](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/index.html), "
"bumubuo sila ng [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-"
"model), na nagbibigay ng ganap na transparency at kontrol para pinong i-tune"
" ang iyong error mitigation workflow. Ang tutorial na [Probabilistic error "
"cancellation with shaded lightcones](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-"
"slc/tutorials/01_getting_started.html), halimbawa, ay nagpapakita kung paano"
" ginagamit ang modelong ito para pagsamahin ang mga advanced na teknik, "
"kabilang ang mga shaded lightcone, probabilistic error cancellation (PEC), "
"Twirled Readout Error eXtinction (TREX), at [measurement-based "
"postselection](/guides/post-selection), para mapabuti pa ang kalidad ng "
"resulta.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  If you prefer a higher level of abstraction, "
"[`EstimatorV2`](/guides/estimator-noise-management) in Qiskit Runtime "
"continues to provide several built-in error mitigation and suppression "
"techniques, which you can easily tune using the "
"[`resilience_level`](/guides/estimator-noise-management#resilience-level) "
"option.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Kung mas gusto mo ang mas mataas na antas ng abstraction, ang "
"[`EstimatorV2`](/guides/estimator-noise-management) sa Qiskit Runtime ay "
"patuloy na nagbibigay ng ilang built-in na teknik sa error mitigation at "
"suppression, na madali mong maaayos gamit ang opsyong "
"[`resilience_level`](/guides/estimator-noise-management#resilience-level).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  To learn more, see the following guides:\n"
msgstr "  Para matuto nang higit pa, tingnan ang mga sumusunod na gabay:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Executor quickstart](/guides/get-started-with-executor)\n"
msgstr "[Executor quickstart](/guides/get-started-with-executor)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Noise learning helper](/guides/noise-learning)\n"
msgstr "[Noise learning helper](/guides/noise-learning)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Both of these new features are currently in beta and require `qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime` version 0.47.0 or higher.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Ang parehong bagong feature na ito ay kasalukuyang nasa beta at "
"nangangailangan ng `qiskit-ibm-runtime` bersyon 0.47.0 o mas mataas.\n"

