#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"latest-runtime-service\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"latest-runtime-service\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Runtime service {#qiskit-runtime-service}"
msgstr "Qiskit Runtime service {#qiskit-runtime-service}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This summary of the latest changes to the Qiskit Runtime service applies to "
"anyone using Qiskit Runtime, regardless of how you communicate with the "
"service (by using `qiskit-ibm-runtime` or otherwise), or which version of "
"the client SDK you use.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang buod na ito ng mga pinakabagong pagbabago sa Qiskit Runtime service ay "
"naaangkop sa sinumang gumagamit ng Qiskit Runtime, anuman ang paraan ng "
"iyong pakikipag-ugnayan sa serbisyo (gamit ang `qiskit-ibm-runtime` o iba "
"pa), o kung aling bersyon ng client SDK ang iyong ginagamit.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "January 2026 {#january-2026-1}"
msgstr "Enero 2026 {#january-2026-1}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[**Directed execution model.**](/guides/directed-execution-model) This new "
"execution model allows you to fine-tune error mitigation and other "
"techniques without sacrificing performance by providing the ingredients to "
"capture design intents on the client side, and shifting the costly "
"generation of circuit variants to the server side. For example, you can use "
"the [Samplomatic library](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/index.html) "
"to define the exact layers in your circuits to apply Pauli-twirling and to "
"inject noise. The new [Executor primitive](/guides/directed-execution-"
"model#executor-primitive) will then follow your directives to generate and "
"execute the randomized circuit variants in Qiskit Runtime.\n"
msgstr ""
"[**Directed execution model.**](/guides/directed-execution-model) Ang bagong"
" execution model na ito ay nagbibigay-daan sa iyo na pinong i-tune ang error"
" mitigation at iba pang mga teknik nang hindi sinasasakripisyo ang "
"performance sa pamamagitan ng pagbibigay ng mga sangkap para makuha ang mga "
"layunin ng disenyo sa client side, at paglilipat ng mamahaling pagbuo ng mga"
" variant ng circuit sa server side. Halimbawa, maaari mong gamitin ang "
"[Samplomatic library](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/index.html) para "
"tukuyin ang eksaktong mga layer sa iyong mga circuit na ilalapat ang Pauli-"
"twirling at mag-inject ng ingay. Ang bagong [Executor "
"primitive](/guides/directed-execution-model#executor-primitive) ay susunod "
"sa iyong mga direktiba para bumuo at isagawa ang mga randomized na variant "
"ng circuit sa Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"**Previous updates**\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"**Mga nakaraang update**\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"new-dynamic-circuits\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"new-dynamic-circuits\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "October 2025 {#october-2025-1}"
msgstr "Oktubre 2025 {#october-2025-1}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The new dynamic circuits is now available to all users on all backends, "
"except some QPUs under the On-Prem Plan.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang bagong dynamic circuits ay available na ngayon sa lahat ng user sa lahat"
" ng backend, maliban sa ilang QPU sa ilalim ng On-Prem Plan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  With this new version, you can run dynamic circuits at utility scale. The "
"initial release offers the following features:\n"
msgstr ""
"  Sa bagong bersyong ito, maaari kang magpatakbo ng mga dynamic circuit sa "
"utility scale. Ang paunang release ay nag-aalok ng mga sumusunod na "
"feature:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "75x execution speedup, thanks to the latest quantum execution stack\n"
msgstr ""
"75x na pagpapabilis ng execution, salamat sa pinakabagong quantum execution "
"stack\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Parallel branch execution, which reduces circuit duration and improves "
"result quality\n"
msgstr ""
"Parallel na pagpapatupad ng branch, na nagbabawas ng circuit duration at "
"nagpapabuti ng kalidad ng resulta\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Support for [classical "
"operations](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_classical) "
"defined in Qiskit, with the exception of bit shift and arithmetic\n"
msgstr ""
"Suporta para sa [mga classical na "
"operasyon](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_classical) na "
"tinukoy sa Qiskit, maliban sa bit shift at arithmetic\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Support for stretch duration in delay instructions. This new type allows "
"design intent to be captured at circuit construction time, and timing "
"resolution at compile time\n"
msgstr ""
"Suporta para sa stretch duration sa mga instruksyong delay. Ang bagong uri "
"na ito ay nagbibigay-daan sa pagkuha ng layunin ng disenyo sa oras ng "
"pagtatayo ng circuit, at resolusyon ng timing sa oras ng compilation\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  Additional features will be rolled out later this year.\n"
msgstr "  Ang mga karagdagang feature ay ilalabas mamaya sa taong ito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  See  [Classical feedforward and control flow](/guides/classical-"
"feedforward-and-control-flow) and [Deferred timing resolution using "
"stretch](/guides/stretch) for more information and code examples.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Tingnan ang [Classical feedforward at control flow](/guides/classical-"
"feedforward-and-control-flow) at [Deferred timing resolution gamit ang "
"stretch](/guides/stretch) para sa karagdagang impormasyon at mga halimbawa "
"ng code.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "5 June 2025 {#5-june-2025-1}"
msgstr "5 Hunyo 2025 {#5-june-2025-1}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now available: Early access to the new version of dynamic circuits on select"
" QPUs. This new version will allow you to run dynamic circuits at utility "
"scale and comes with improvements in speed, quality, and usability. Premium "
"Plan and Flex Plan users interested in participating in this early access "
"can [contact us](/guides/support).\n"
msgstr ""
"Available na ngayon: Maagang access sa bagong bersyon ng mga dynamic circuit"
" sa mga piling QPU. Ang bagong bersyong ito ay magbibigay-daan sa iyo na "
"magpatakbo ng mga dynamic circuit sa utility scale at may mga pagpapabuti sa"
" bilis, kalidad, at kadalian ng paggamit. Ang mga user ng Premium Plan at "
"Flex Plan na interesadong lumahok sa maagang access na ito ay maaaring "
"[makipag-ugnayan sa amin](/guides/support).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3 February 2025 {#3-february-2025}"
msgstr "3 Pebrero 2025 {#3-february-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Pulse-level control on all IBM Quantum processors has been removed.  "
"Additionally, the pulse module is scheduled for removal in Qiskit SDK v2.0."
"  Instead, you can use fractional gates that are now built into the "
"Instruction Set Architecture (ISA). For full details and help migrating your"
" code, refer to [Migrate from Qiskit Pulse to fractional "
"gates](/guides/pulse-migration).\n"
msgstr ""
"Tinanggal na ang Pulse-level control sa lahat ng IBM Quantum processor. "
"Bukod dito, ang pulse module ay nakatakdang alisin sa Qiskit SDK v2.0. Sa "
"halip, maaari kang gumamit ng mga fractional gate na built-in na ngayon sa "
"Instruction Set Architecture (ISA). Para sa buong detalye at tulong sa pag-"
"migrate ng iyong code, sumangguni sa [Mag-migrate mula sa Qiskit Pulse "
"patungo sa mga fractional gate](/guides/pulse-migration).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"new-version-dynamic-circuits\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"new-version-dynamic-circuits\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "2 February 2025 {#2-february-2025}"
msgstr "2 Pebrero 2025 {#2-february-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Starting 2 June 2025 and continuing through the year, IBM Quantum will begin a gradual rollout of new features to [dynamic circuits](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) that will enable them at the utility scale.\n"
"Improvements include the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"- Simula 2 Hunyo 2025 at magpapatuloy sa buong taon, magsisimula ang IBM Quantum ng unti-unting paglalabas ng mga bagong feature sa [mga dynamic circuit](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) na magbibigay-daan sa kanila sa utility scale.\n"
"Kasama sa mga pagpapabuti ang sumusunod:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "A 75x speedup in execution by using the Gen3 engine stack\n"
msgstr ""
"75x na pagpapabilis ng execution sa pamamagitan ng paggamit ng Gen3 engine "
"stack\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Parallel execution of branches, which reduces circuit duration and improves "
"result quality\n"
msgstr ""
"Parallel na pagpapatupad ng mga branch, na nagbabawas ng circuit duration at"
" nagpapabuti ng kalidad ng resulta\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Improvement in mid-circuit measurement\n"
msgstr "Pagpapabuti ng mid-circuit measurement\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Better integration with dynamical decoupling\n"
msgstr "Mas mahusay na integrasyon sa dynamical decoupling\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "More visibility of circuit timing information\n"
msgstr "Mas malawak na visibility ng impormasyon ng circuit timing\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To accelerate the rollout, the following capabilities are now deprecated and"
" will be no longer supported on or around 2 June 2025:\n"
msgstr ""
"Para mapabilis ang paglalabas, ang mga sumusunod na kakayahan ay deprecated "
"na ngayon at hindi na susuportahan sa o pagkatapos ng 2 Hunyo 2025:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The `while`, `for`, and `switch` control flow constructs\n"
msgstr "Ang mga construct ng control flow na `while`, `for`, at `switch`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The ability to use control flow instructions inside the body of a branch (as"
" in, nested control flow)\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang kakayahang gumamit ng mga instruksyon ng control flow sa loob ng katawan"
" ng isang branch (tulad ng, nested na control flow)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Conditional measurements\n"
msgstr "Mga conditional measurement\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "7 January 2025 {#7-january-2025}"
msgstr "7 Enero 2025 {#7-january-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The rollout of the Gen3 engine stack begins today. This engine stack gives a"
" 75x speedup in execution.  The rollout will be done on one QPU at a time, "
"where a percentage of the jobs on the QPU will use the Gen3 path.  You can "
"also force the Gen3 path using the `gen3-turbo` experimental option. Note "
"that this engine stack is not compatible with fractional gates, pulse gates,"
" or dynamic circuits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nagsisimula ngayon ang paglalabas ng Gen3 engine stack. Ang engine stack na "
"ito ay nagbibigay ng 75x na pagpapabilis ng execution. Ang paglalabas ay "
"gagawin nang isang QPU sa isang pagkakataon, kung saan ang isang porsyento "
"ng mga trabaho sa QPU ay gagamit ng Gen3 na landas. Maaari mo ring pilitin "
"ang Gen3 na landas gamit ang eksperimental na opsyong `gen3-turbo`. Tandaan "
"na ang engine stack na ito ay hindi compatible sa mga fractional gate, pulse"
" gate, o dynamic circuit.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "15 October 2024 {#15-october-2024}"
msgstr "15 Oktubre 2024 {#15-october-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Support for `backend.run` has ended.\n"
msgstr "Natapos na ang suporta para sa `backend.run`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1 October 2024 {#1-october-2024}"
msgstr "1 Oktubre 2024 {#1-october-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Parameterized delay gates have been deprecated.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga parameterized delay gate ay deprecated na.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "15 August 2024 {#15-august-2024}"
msgstr "15 Agosto 2024 {#15-august-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Probabilistic error amplification (PEA) error mitigation method is now "
"available for Estimator V2. See the [`ZneOptions` API "
"reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-zne-"
"options) for more details.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang paraan ng error mitigation na Probabilistic error amplification (PEA) ay"
" available na ngayon para sa Estimator V2. Tingnan ang [API reference ng "
"`ZneOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-"
"zne-options) para sa karagdagang detalye.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A new helper program `noise-learner` is now available. It allows "
"characterizing the noise processes affecting the gates in one or more "
"circuits of interest, based on the Pauli-Lindblad noise model. The output "
"noise model can then be passed to Estimator via the `layer_noise_model` "
"option.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang bagong helper program na `noise-learner` ay available na ngayon. "
"Nagbibigay-daan ito sa pagsasalarawan ng mga proseso ng ingay na "
"nakakaapekto sa mga gate sa isa o higit pang mga circuit ng interes, batay "
"sa Pauli-Lindblad noise model. Ang output noise model ay maaaring ipasa sa "
"Estimator sa pamamagitan ng opsyong `layer_noise_model`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "V1 primitives are no longer supported.\n"
msgstr "Hindi na sinusuportahan ang mga V1 primitive.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3 July 2024 {#3-july-2024}"
msgstr "3 Hulyo 2024 {#3-july-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following endpoints are deprecated and will be removed on or after 3 "
"October 2024: [`GET /stream/jobs`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime/tags/jobs#tags__jobs__operations__get_stream_jobs_state_updates)"
" and [`GET /stream/jobs/{id}`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/tags/jobs#tags__jobs__operations__get_stream_job_logs_jid). This "
"removal has the following impacts:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga sumusunod na endpoint ay deprecated at aalisin sa o pagkatapos ng 3 "
"Oktubre 2024: [`GET /stream/jobs`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime/tags/jobs#tags__jobs__operations__get_stream_jobs_state_updates)"
" at [`GET /stream/jobs/{id}`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/tags/jobs#tags__jobs__operations__get_stream_job_logs_jid). Ang pag-"
"aalis na ito ay may mga sumusunod na epekto:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After the endpoints are removed, `job.stream_results()` and "
"`job.interim_results()` will be removed from the [qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime) client.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos alisin ang mga endpoint, ang `job.stream_results()` at "
"`job.interim_results()` ay aalisin mula sa client na [qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additional methods, such as `job.result()` currently use the deprecated "
"endpoints.  Upgrade to `qiskit_ibm_runtime` 0.25 or later before the "
"endpoints are removed to avoid disruption.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga karagdagang paraan, tulad ng `job.result()`, ay kasalukuyang "
"gumagamit ng mga deprecated na endpoint. I-upgrade sa `qiskit_ibm_runtime` "
"0.25 o mas bago bago alisin ang mga endpoint para maiwasan ang "
"pagkaantala.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "18 June 2024 {#18-june-2024}"
msgstr "18 Hunyo 2024 {#18-june-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `optimization_level` option is deprecated for Estimator V2 and will be "
"removed no sooner than 30 September 2024.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang opsyong `optimization_level` ay deprecated para sa Estimator V2 at "
"aalisin nang hindi mas maaga sa 30 Setyembre 2024.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3 June 2024 {#3-june-2024}"
msgstr "3 Hunyo 2024 {#3-june-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Probabilistic error amplification (PEA) error mitigation method is now "
"available as an experimental option for Estimator V2. See the "
"[`EstimatorOptions` API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime/options-estimator-options) for more details.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang paraan ng error mitigation na Probabilistic error amplification (PEA) ay"
" available na ngayon bilang eksperimental na opsyon para sa Estimator V2. "
"Tingnan ang [API reference ng "
"`EstimatorOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/options-estimator-options) para sa karagdagang detalye.\n"

